    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/4227d867ff71b0a7d352437d18566ad3.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/4227d867ff71b0a7d352437d18566ad3.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Mr. Magic is an awesome, third-person, action-adventure game where you become a superhero. <br>Unlock powerful skills by visiting secret places around the globe to retrieve mystical skills before they fall into the wrong hands.<br>Master extraordinary abilities like teleportation and psychokinesis with mystical secrets!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/39187e8100be2fab139a02298c776acb.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/39187e8100be2fab139a02298c776acb.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>This game is inspired by awesome movies from Marvel and Norman to bring similar experiences from movies into this game.<br>All similarities are purely coincidental.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/cc12530b75a06304ad3341bcdd7418d6.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/cc12530b75a06304ad3341bcdd7418d6.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The story starts when our hero goes to a temple in the Himalayas to learn meditation techniques. Instead, he got a manuscript to unlock magical, powerful skills. Now, he needs to protect the knowledge from dark spirits. It is time to go and find all those magical secrets in different places in the world, from underwater templates and regular cities to templates in the Himalayas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/2a6fd80dd28ee6113632230cef94c8f9.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/2a6fd80dd28ee6113632230cef94c8f9.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Features:<br>- Flexible combat system<br>- Insane psychokinesis abilities to move objects and even enemies<br>- Great paranormal skills like teleportation from one place to another<br>- Levitation system<br>- Awesome graphics of different locations by Unreal Engine<br>- Unreal cinematic effects<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/345c5612d60509f8822404239be5caed.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/345c5612d60509f8822404239be5caed.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/4227d867ff71b0a7d352437d18566ad3.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/4227d867ff71b0a7d352437d18566ad3.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Mr. Magic is an awesome, third-person, action-adventure game where you become a superhero. <br>Unlock powerful skills by visiting secret places around the globe to retrieve mystical skills before they fall into the wrong hands.<br>Master extraordinary abilities like teleportation and psychokinesis with mystical secrets!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/39187e8100be2fab139a02298c776acb.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/39187e8100be2fab139a02298c776acb.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>This game is inspired by awesome movies from Marvel and Norman to bring similar experiences from movies into this game.<br>All similarities are purely coincidental.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/cc12530b75a06304ad3341bcdd7418d6.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/cc12530b75a06304ad3341bcdd7418d6.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The story starts when our hero goes to a temple in the Himalayas to learn meditation techniques. Instead, he got a manuscript to unlock magical, powerful skills. Now, he needs to protect the knowledge from dark spirits. It is time to go and find all those magical secrets in different places in the world, from underwater templates and regular cities to templates in the Himalayas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/2a6fd80dd28ee6113632230cef94c8f9.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/2a6fd80dd28ee6113632230cef94c8f9.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Features:<br>- Flexible combat system<br>- Insane psychokinesis abilities to move objects and even enemies<br>- Great paranormal skills like teleportation from one place to another<br>- Levitation system<br>- Awesome graphics of different locations by Unreal Engine<br>- Unreal cinematic effects<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/345c5612d60509f8822404239be5caed.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/345c5612d60509f8822404239be5caed.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1712844365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409910/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1712844365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
